  text="Says the Croix-des-Bouquets plain is under heavy fire; about 100 Salvadoran elite troops are sweeping Santo, Marassa, Shada and Croix-des-Bouquets with Haitian police (PNH) and GSF armored vehicles; hospitals are overwhelmed with wounded gang members; gunmen tried to seize doctors in Santo 22 and Sainte Camille; and Dominican President Abinader ordered the border closed completely.",
