gangs=[
 ("Viv Ansanm (\"Living Together\")","The coalition of the main Port-au-Prince gangs, formed in 2024 per El País (one source dates it September 2023). Jimmy \"Barbecue\" Chérizier is a leading figure and its spokesman. Designated a terrorist organization by the US on 2 May 2025. The Miami Herald's analyst says it had been fragmenting, and that this incident may restore its cohesion.","https://www.state.gov/designation-of-viv-ansanm-and-gran-grif"),
 ("400 Mawozo","Led by Wilson Joseph, \"Lanmò San Jou,\" operating in Croix-des-Bouquets and part of Viv Ansanm. He posted a video of ammunition and challenged Bukele (Anadolu). On 24 Oct new video showed him in a pickup with ammunition saying \"We have to fight just to stay alive\" (via HaitiInfoProj). On 25 Oct a TikTok video blamed Chen Mechan for the four Salvadorans' deaths and said he would have taken them alive and negotiated with Bukele; a longer version shows three men he says are police held in his area (Le Patrimoine 509) and, in César Moreno's Spanish version, a call to shoot foreigners. Radio Télé Confiance says he and Jeff Gwo Lwa have been in Saut-d'Eau since Wednesday. Listín Diario, citing the UN Panel of Experts, says most of 900,000 rounds diverted from Dominican police stocks went to 400 Mawozo and other groups. El Demócrata reports fighting against the gang in Croix-des-Bouquets. His 25 Oct TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@plip_plip_400/video/7700668419598732558","https://www.aa.com.tr/en/americas/el-salvador-deploys-special-forces-to-haiti-to-rescue-kidnapped-troops/4099174"),
 ("Chen Mechan (\"Vicious Dog\")","Part of Viv Ansanm. Haïti Liberté, relaying Chérizier, says its fighters ambushed the GSF members in Santo; Lanmò San Jou now says the four died in its area. Salazar names Claude Celestin as its head. Martínez says its base was destroyed (not yet reported by others). The burned remains handed over on 24 Oct were collected at a drop site in its territory (Miami Herald). Radio Télé Confiance says its leader is dug in at Marin 12; another source, Thériel Thélus, says he is hiding in Lizon and moving by motorcycle, that the gang has regrouped and blocked the Croix-des-Missions bridge, and that a video attributed to it says the Salvadorans fired first and that its men tried to put out the fire (not yet reported by others).","https://haitiliberte.com/the-u-s-denies-that-its-salvadoran-mercenaries-have-been-killed/"),
 ("Kraze Baryè","Controls territory in Tabarre where a GSF patrol came under fire in July (Haitian Times).","https://haitiantimes.com/2026/10/19/four-salvadoran-soldiers-gsf-haiti-missing-attack/"),
 ("Gran Grif, Kokorat San Ras and Canaan","From March 2026 they attacked dozens of localities in the lower Artibonite; Gran Grif was designated a terrorist group by the US with Viv Ansanm (UN Panel of Experts report, hosted on HaitiDocs, and State Department).","https://www.haitidocs.org/doc/un-panel-experts-2026"),
 ("Krisla","Named by the Miami Herald's analyst as one of two leaders who spoke publicly this week.","https://www.miamiherald.com/news/nation-world/world/americas/haiti/article317750804.html"),
]
